  "owner": "Tim + GiGi",
  "raised_by": "Tim King",
  "source_doc": "Tim King & Claude working session (Sept 21, 2026)",
  "source_section": "Raised internally after catching the site tagline in three different live wordings — not from a written review document",
  "distilled": "Define an explicit content-promotion pipeline — Sandbox, WIP, and Production as three distinct tiers; a status ladder (Proposed → Under Review → Concept Agreed → Text Approved → Adopted → Published) so “Adopted” in WIP is never mistaken for live; a short checklist requiring every occurrence of a changed value to be found and updated together before anything is marked Published; and a production changelog logging what shipped, in which files, from which WIP item, and how it was verified — so the next drift shows up as a diff instead of being caught by eye weeks later.",
