  "source_section": "Raised Sept 25, 2026 while drafting the Work Product in the Role Container spec",
  "distilled": "Retire Future State from the working-relationship model everywhere. Each activity carries two values only: Current State and Progression Ceiling. Remove the term from documents and the register, and retire the future field from the sandbox master data.",
