  "raw": "“My suggestions are mostly about making it a little more operational so that we can look at any row and immediately know not only where it stands, but what happens next and what ‘complete’ really means.”",
  "converged": "GR-045",
  "spec_doc": "docs/wip/requirements_register.html",
