  "distilled": "Define what an organization receives from its work-side assessment — an executive summary, a dashboard, the exceptions report, the process detail and later an infographic — and a defined role hand-off of work-side results that feeds GiGi's human-impact side. The work side covers Work Change and Role Impact; Human Impact onward is hers.",
